A photorealistic image of a tower of weathered cardboard moving boxes stacked precariously high, casting long afternoon shadows across a sunlit empty apartment floor with warm wooden parquet. Through large windows, a glimpse of Singapore's tropical greenery and neighboring high-rise buildings. A single ethernet cable snakes hopefully from one open box toward a wall outlet, its blue tip glowing faintly. The scene conveys exhaustion mixed with anticipation, the chaos of transition meeting the promise of a new beginning.
